4. NORMATIVE STANDARDS, RFCS & SPECIFICATIONS REFERENCED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

lh-wireguard-mesh-agent implements or validates compliance against the following public
engineering standards, RFCs, and security specifications:

  * WireGuard Cryptographic Network Tunnel Protocol (Noise_IKpsk2_25519_ChaChaPoly_BLAKE2s), IETF RFC 7748 (Curve25519), RFC 8032 (Ed25519)
